@startuml as-is
' AS-IS process as a UML activity diagram (the requirements accept BPMN or
' UML activity): a reader looks for the answer to a question about a book.
' Save the render as as-is.png here.
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName Arial

|Reader|
start
:Has a question about a book
("who is this man?", "where is this idea?");
repeat
  :Guess which book holds the answer;
  :Open the book in a reader app;
  :Guess the author's words and search this one book;
  if (Passage found?) then (yes)
    :Read the passage;
    stop
  else (no)
  endif
repeat while (Try other words or another book?) is (yes)
->no;
if (Ask a general chatbot?) then (yes)
  :Get an answer from the chatbot's memory,
  with no passage to check it against;
else (no)
  :Give up;
endif
stop
@enduml
